    "description": "<p>So Speaks Cecelyne permanently alters the costs and mechanics of the Infernal's Cecelyne Excellency suite. The First Cecelyne Excellency now provides two dice per mote spent rather than one, and the Second Cecelyne Excellency now provides one automatic success per mote spent rather than one per two motes. Cecelyne Inevitability Technique no longer requires a Willpower expenditure, costing four motes instead. So Speaks Cecelyne is incompatible with Effortless Cecelyne Dominance.</p>",
